<title>USA: Kingdon holds 9.75 pct Bolivia Power stake.</title>
<headline>Kingdon holds 9.75 pct Bolivia Power stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kingdon Capital Management Corp, a New York-based investment adviser, said on Monday that it has acquired a 9.75 percent stake, or 409,900 common shares, in Bolivia Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Kingdon said it paid $16.2 million for the stake and holds it for investment purposes.</p>
<p>It said its latest transactions include the net purchase of 266,8900 shares between July 89 and August 15 at prices ranging from $37.42 to $39.81 a share.</p>
</text>
